        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7035/0, Rectangular Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 7 Inch Pocket Door Dummy Set is available in a great selection of finish colors. This stylish flush pull is easy to install. It is pressure mounted into the mortised face of the door and secured with 4 screws on the top and the bottom of the cut out. This Rectangular Flush Pull is for use on sliding door hardware. Its slim 3/32 inch projection means it can even be used on sliding pocket doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/7-inch-pocket-door-passage-set-omnia-7035-n\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/7-inch-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-7035-l\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/7-inch-pocket-door-keyed-entry-set-omnia-7035-a\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7035-0-specifications.pdf?v=1704262370\"><b>Omnia 7035 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually:</b> one (1) rectangle flush pull and all mounting hardware. <b>For One Side of (1) Door.</b></p>",
